OL,3,GNEWSAUnderground heat pipes to be laid
OL,4,Abeneath streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to install pipes as part of a
OL,7,Flow-carbon underground heating system
OL,8,Fin Hull will begin this week.
OL,10,FHull City Council said the pipework
OL,11,Fwill be fitted along a small section of
OL,12,FLowgate, Guildhall Road and Wilberforce
OL,13,FDrive between 9 September and 11
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FThe Hull District Heat Network project
OL,17,F(HDHN) will transfer heat generated
OL,18,Ffrom waste from an energy centre on
OL,19,FTrippett Street to buildings across the
OL,20,Fcity.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
